Journey: Manager creates an order
Tags: @smoke
Role: manager
Variables: qty=3

Run journey "open-the-orders-page" with role=manager
Go to /orders/new
Fill the Quantity field with ${qty}
Click the "Submit order" button
  Expect the page contains "created"
Capture the text of testid=order-total as total
Set variable doubled to total * 2
Expect ${doubled} equals "99"
Run query "OPEN_ORDERS" on shop with customer=1 and store the rows as open
